    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i run a manufacturing plant in ohio and we're getting hit hard by these new carbon emission standards. i have a meeting with our local reps next week and i need to make a strong case for why these specific regulations are going to hurt us. can you give me a detailed list of the main economic and operational arguments against these new standards so i can present them? thanks.",
