    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a really intense way to put it. I see your point about the economic impact, but what about the environmental side? People are saying these rules are the only way to prevent long-term damage. How would you respond to the argument that the cost of doing nothing is actually higher than the cost of these regulations?",
