      "content": "The idea that we must choose between profit and survival is a false dichotomy because the current regulations are poorly designed and will actually accelerate economic collapse, which is the true threat to survival. We should support a transition to green energy, but only through market-based incentives and technology innovation, not through punitive mandates that destroy the very industries needed to pay for the transition. If we let these rules stand, we lose our manufacturing base and our ability to innovate, leaving us with neither jobs nor a viable economy to fund environmental solutions.",
